    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16485" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀστερ-ίας</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>starred</i>: hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b> a fish, <i>Squalus stellaris,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Philyll.
				1.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				543a17
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> a bird,
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b> perh. <i>bittern,
				Ardea stellaris,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				609b22
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> a kind of
				<i>hawk,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				620a18
			</span></i>; 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρυσάετος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				2.39
			</span></i>.</div>
